AU&quot; + &quot;OUTILLAGE&quot;</p><p>Bonjour Ludivine,</p><p>Sur ces demandes tu veux que je te pr&eacute;vois l&rsquo;&eacute;lectricit&eacute; comme ce qui est sch&eacute;matis&eacute; ? Car ce n&rsquo;est pas dans ton descriptif.</p><p>Cordialement,</p><p>[<a href=\\"https://eurobox.fr/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/EuroBox-Bleu-1024x888.png\\">https://eurobox.fr/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/EuroBox-Bleu-1024x888.png</a>]<br/>[facebook]&lt;<a href=\\"https://www.facebook.com/EuroboxConteneurs?paipv=0&eav=AfbuBLaGVA44QUrYqErsdr2MqTdL04DhHI67YzLD-7UIuvPUjtBI_Cwc-2K9r0epf0w&_rdr\\">https://www.facebook.com/EuroboxConteneurs?paipv=0&amp;eav=AfbuBLaGVA44QUrYqErsdr2MqTdL04DhHI67YzLD-7UIuvPUjtBI_Cwc-2K9r0epf0w&amp;_rdr</a>&gt;<br/>[linkedin]&lt;<a href=\\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/86427824/admin/feed/posts/\\">https://www.linkedin.com/company/86427824/admin/feed/posts/</a>&gt;<br/>[instagram]&lt;<a href=\\"https://www.instagram.com/eurobox_container/\\">https://www.instagram.com/eurobox_container/</a>&gt;</p><p>St&eacute;phane ROBERT<br/>Charg&eacute; d&apos;Affaires<br/>EUROBOX<br/>[mobilePhone]<br/>0478021153&lt;tel:0478021153&gt; | 0749330157&lt;tel:0749330157&gt;<br/>[emailAddress]<br/><a href=\\"mailto:stephane@eurobox.fr\\">stephane@eurobox.fr</a>&lt;<a href=\\"mailto:stephane@eurobox.fr\\">mailto:stephane@eurobox.fr</a>&gt;<br/>[address]<br/>111 rue de Chassagne - 69360 TERNAY</p><p>[<a href=\\"https://img-cache.net/im/3021301/59faa02f01ebc3deb66a9ebfceb5a882dc66c0817dec4e0389048b2aa7f5f646.png?e=wcFz_icq3QG9HN9qOCF8W0hZx1L-zHvxmzcRCRKdUsMPBs2lr_XkcP7e8PJBAMNcvibqTDa4pmy5dYmKdljYOPt1p43VyrqzDfZR_i-tjGz3cgt_FVk0aIotTiESSKEMvFWZfb2d5MAJh9D9C7Ffr8GSY7yvrwBCnNJl_1-N9MRCcWiI-M8VydeqMcvQwzrA3fDNvvhn70cYGrDYM-x2Fm0SCh9VbE5hkPtvaWScRGrrIS-ShmNH\\">https://img-cache.net/im/3021301/59faa02f01ebc3deb66a9ebfceb5a882dc66c0817dec4e0389048b2aa7f5f646.png?e=wcFz_icq3QG9HN9qOCF8W0hZx1L-zHvxmzcRCRKdUsMPBs2lr_XkcP7e8PJBAMNcvibqTDa4pmy5dYmKdljYOPt1p43VyrqzDfZR_i-tjGz3cgt_FVk0aIot